  triage:title "Four stale .triage .ttl records reference pre-redo gamed state, not current commit" ;
  triage:description "Four stale .triage/phase-AG/findings/*.ttl records (AG19-ATM-QA-AG19-001/002/003, AG19-RBQA-F003) reference headShas (5d20ca5a, 59225e0f) and code constructs (execute_ack_reply_plan, AckReplyDisposition branches, a divergent Err/Ok classification) that do not exist in the reviewed commit 77c99484 -- they describe the pre-redo/gamed state of this branch. Recommend reconciling/closing these on integrate/phase-AG (not the feature worktree) before AG.20 starts, so a future reviewer doesn't mistake them for live findings. Note: per standing rule, .ttl edits only happen on integrate/phase-X, never on a feature-sprint worktree." ;
